- Health checks, circuit breakers, and backpressure
- Multi-backend routing with graceful degradation

## Code Example

```javascript
// Pseudo routing skeleton
function routePrompt(req){
  const tenant = req.tenantId;
  const candidateBackends = pickBackends(tenant);
  if(!backendAvailable(candidateBackends)) return fallbackParaphrase(req);
  const target = selectHealthyBackend(candidateBackends, tenant);
  return forward(req, target);
}
```

